    "domestic_electricity_zero_vat": {
      "description": "VAT on domestic electricity is 0% instead of 5% from 1 October 2026 to 30 June 2027. It applies in Great Britain from October 2026 and across the UK from April 2027. It covers electricity only, not gas. Each year counts its share of a year's electricity use: about 57% in 2026-27 (October to March) and 22% in 2027-28 (April to June).",
