            }
          },
          "card_note": "The earnings limit is 16 hours at the National Living Wage, rounded up to the pound: £228 a week in 2030-31 and £234 in 2031-32. Current law stops the allowance at £1 over it. With the measure it falls by £1 for each £1 above the limit, and runs out at £324 a week in 2030-31 and £332 in 2031-32."
        }
